      "description": "The Financial Aid Administrator, as part of the OFA Operations and Scholarship team, is responsible for reviewing and processing award program reports, student applicant eligibility and verification, scholarship and partnership discounts, and award revisions for institutional, federal, and state programs. ",
      "department": null
    },
    "https://ekze.fa.us2.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/1999": {
