      "description": "Reporting to the Treasurer, the Procurement Manager is responsible for supervising the university’s procurement function and managing vendor and supplier relationships. The Procurement Manager will partner with senior leadership to maintain and enhance effective procurement controls, policies, and procedures that ensure competitive, fair, and compliant purchasing across the institution.\nThis position manages a team of 2-3 procurement professionals. \n",
